# Line endings: text files are stored with LF in the repository and checked out with LF on every platform,
# matching .editorconfig. Git detects binary files itself; the extensions below are listed so it never guesses.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.bin binary
*.glb binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ktx2 binary
*.m4a binary
*.flac binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wasm binary
*.ogg binary
*.wav binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.gz binary
*.br binary
*.ply binary
*.splat binary
